      "content": "It sounds like you're experiencing a sense of frustration and possibly even harassment. Documenting these events can be helpful in tracking patterns and potential bias. Start by keeping a record of specific dates, times, and details of each incident, as well as any reactions or responses from your coworkers or superiors. Consider writing down your experiences in a journal or using an app to help you keep track of your events. This can also be helpful in case you need to file a formal complaint.",
